Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我有一個很在意的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:45.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我有一個很關心的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:52.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我總是對那女孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:57.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對那女孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:03.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的腦海裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的心裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:12.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一直想像著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:20.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,三重同學
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:58.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我對那個女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:05.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對那個女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:17.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對那個女孩的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:18.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:22.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:22.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,早安
